# Starforge — docs hygiene

## Laws

1. A rule holds laws. Dates, queue, and temporary standing belong on the live map — not in a rule.
2. Open work stays on the live map. Finished plans move to `docs/archive/` in the change that finishes them.
3. Links in live docs are relative and must resolve.

## Quick check

If a rule mentions a date, a build queue, or temporary standing, move that fact to the live map.
